  "bodyHash": "f26d9a1deaa68298",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Your Items Are Safe 是一個模組，可作為現有墓碑模組的替代品，且僅使用原版方塊。當玩家死亡時，它會防止物品消失。方法是生成一個裝備了該玩家裝備的盔甲架，以及一個裝有背包物品的箱子。箱子上會放置一塊寫有玩家名稱的告示牌。如果背包物品無法放入一個箱子，會在上方生成另一個箱子。盔甲架會立在箱子上方。所有功能均可透過設定檔開啟或關閉。如果玩家在虛空中死亡，箱子將生成在死亡座標的正上方。<br><br>為保持遊戲平衡，只有在玩家的背包中有足夠木材時，才能生成箱子和盔甲架。生成一個箱子需要 2 個原木、8 個木板或 1 個現成的箱子。生成盔甲架需要 1 個原木或 3 個木板。模組會優先搜尋原木，其次是木板，最後是箱子。如果找不到所需的原材料，箱子和盔甲架將<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>不會</strong></span>生成。如果您希望即使沒有原材料也始終生成它們，也可以在設定檔中進行調整。<br><br>此模組還包含生成玩家頭部並放置在盔甲架上的功能。這有助於識別是哪位玩家在哪裡死亡。如果玩家當時戴著頭盔，頭盔會被放入箱子中。預設為啟用狀態。同樣地，這項功能也可以在設定檔中關閉。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveItemsInInventoryForCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，若玩家死亡時背包內沒有任何物品，則不會生成箱子或盔甲架。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>addPlayerHeadToArmorStand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否要在盔甲架上添加玩家頭部。如果玩家佩戴了頭盔，它將被放入箱子中。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createArmorStand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家死亡時是否生成盔甲架。如果禁用，玩家的裝備將直接放入箱子內。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createSignWithPlayerName</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在箱子上放置寫有死亡玩家名稱的告示牌。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>needChestMaterials</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">生成死亡箱子是否需要材料。可以是現成的箱子，也可以是原材料消耗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>needArmorStandMaterials</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">生成死亡盔甲架是否需要材料。可以是現成的盔甲架，也可以是原材料消耗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>needSignMaterials</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用 'createSignWithPlayerName' 時，製作告示牌是否需要材料。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignoreStoneMaterialNeed</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">僅在啟用 'needChestAndArmorStandMaterials' 時相關。生成盔甲架需要 1 個石板，但我認為忽略此需求是可以接受的。如果啟用，死亡時背包中就不需要石頭。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createChestAboveVoid</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當玩家在虛空中死亡時，是否在最低建築高度正上方放置箱子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createVoidPlatform</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在虛空中的箱子下方生成 3x3 的平台。必須啟用 'createChestAboveVoid'。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCreationFailure</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果因缺少材料而無法生成箱子或盔甲架，是否發送訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCreationSuccess</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當箱子（多個）和盔甲架成功生成時，是否發送訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendDeathCoordinatesInChat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在聊天視窗中，於 'sendMessageOnCreationFailure'/'sendMessageOnCreationSuccess' 訊息下方發送玩家的死亡座標。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>creationFailureMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Your items are not safe due to having insufficient materials. Missing: %plankamount% planks.\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用 'sendMessageOnCreationFailure' 時，生成失敗所發送的訊息。可替換的變數：%plankamount%, %stoneamount%。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>creationSuccessMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Your items are safe at your death location.\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用 'sendMessageOnCreationSuccess' 時，生成成功所發送的訊息。</span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡後生成的盔甲架與箱子：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"527\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡後生成了兩個箱子，因為背包物品無法裝入單一箱子：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"527\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡後生成了一個箱子與一個盔甲架：</span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"530\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上述的死亡情況結果如下：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此處玩家背包中沒有木材。箱子/盔甲架未生成：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/e.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">玩家背包中確實有一些木板，但數量不足。聊天視窗會透過訊息顯示此情況：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"532\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">背包已完全裝滿，因此需要 2 個箱子來存放所有物品。幸運的是，玩家擁有超過 19 個木板：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當玩家在虛空中死亡時，箱子會生成在其初始位置的正上方，並附帶一座圓石平台。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/h.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡座標會發送在聊天視窗中。可在設定檔中關閉此功能。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/i.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您即可在任何模組包中自由使用本模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
